# Backend

Thin Express BFF. Consumer of scoring data — never compute a score.

- Routes: `GET /api/readiness/:lookup`, `POST /api/readiness/:lookup/actions/:id/complete`
- Outbound calls only through `clients/corePlatform.js`
- Draft core contract (confirm before going live):
  - `GET /internal/farmer/:lookup/score`
  - `GET /internal/farmer/:lookup/actions`
  - `POST /internal/farmer/:lookup/actions/:id/complete`
  - `GET /internal/zone/:zoneId/advisory`
- Localize raw keys into the display-ready payload in this service
- Mock when `CORE_PLATFORM_API_URL` is unset; swap the client, not the route handlers
- Env: `CORE_PLATFORM_API_URL`, `CORE_PLATFORM_API_KEY`, `DEFAULT_LOCALE`, `PORT`
